0..59 Comment "// Deployments the check refuses before any process starts."
60..62 Comment "//"
63..141 Comment "// A deployment pairs a role\'s requirement with a site\'s offer, and a mismatch"
142..202 Comment "// must stop the deployment rather than the role at arrival."
203..205 Comment "//"
206..283 Comment "// This file is a site and a manifold at once. The site offers a clock and no"
284..363 Comment "// store. Placing `far`, which requires `Store`, at it is refused naming `get`,"
364..434 Comment "// the first member the offer lacks. `nowhere` is no world the program"
435..513 Comment "// declares, so its placement is refused by name. The file itself settles, and"
514..566 Comment "// `gandr check` of it as a deployment refuses both."
567..569 Comment "//"
570..648 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.gandr` — the program, whose `far`"
649..670 Comment "//   requires `Store`"
671..748 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.site.gandr` — a site offering it"
749..823 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/cli.rs` — the check refusing both"
825..885 Comment "// The deployment theories, from `std.manifold` by its path."
